Amiga UNIX material
-------------------

On 2026-09-23 Amiga Corporation approved distributing the Commodore Amiga
binaries that this project builds on; the project reads this as lifting the
restriction on releasing Amiga UNIX to the public. This directory
nevertheless contains no Amix source, binary, manual, tape or disk image,
apart from small text excerpts used as test fixtures (system account tables
without password hashes, a few contents(4) records). Tools that work on
factory material (tools/repo/repackage-stock.py) read it from the user's own
copy.
